    "text": "To eallum folce.\nEala leofan men, understanda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t so\u00f0 is, hit w\u00e6s nu fela geara, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feisse \u00feeode rixode unrihta fela,\nFor\u00f0am \u00e6r \u00feisum w\u00e6s gehwar swicdom swi\u00f0ra, \u00feonne wisdom, and \u00feuhte hwilum wisost, se \u00fee w\u00e6s\nNe bearh nu for oft gesib \u00feam sibban \u00fee ma, \u00fee fremdan, ne f\u00e6der his bearne ne hwilum bearn his\nAnd \u00fei is \u00feisse \u00f0eode fela hearma ons\u00e6ge.\nNe dohte hit \u00e6r \u00feisum inne ne ute, ac w\u00e6s here and hungor, bryne and blodgite on gewelhwilcan ende\nFor\u00feam on \u00feisum earde w\u00e6s, swa hit \u00feincan m\u00e6g, unrihta fela and tealte getriw\u00f0a \u00e6ghwar mid\nFela syn forsworene and swi\u00f0e forlogene and wed eac abrocene oft and gelome; and \u00fe\u00e6t is gesyne on\nAc uton don, swa us \u00feearf is, beon ymbe \u00fea bote, geswican unrihtes and gebugan to rihte, \u00feonne\nUton helpan ure silfra \u00fea hwile, \u00fee we magon and motan, \u00fei l\u00e6s we forwur\u00f0an, \u00feonne we l\u00e6st wenan.\nLa leofan men, hw\u00e6t, we ful georne witan, \u00fe\u00e6t nu fela geara men na ne rohton for oft, hw\u00e6t hi\nAc wear\u00f0 \u00fees \u00f0eodscipe swi\u00f0e forsingod \u00feurh mor\u00f0d\u00e6da and \u00feurh mand\u00e6da, \u00feurh stala and \u00f0urh\nAnd eac syn \u00feurh a\u00f0bricas and \u00feurh wedbricas forloren and forlogen ma, \u00feonne scolde.\nAc uton geswican georne unrihtes and wi\u00f0 god \u00feingian, swa we geornost magon: he us gefilste \u00feurh his",
